192407851308", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820141_1598192411184641_7768509647284292344_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wl9nB0pLFvAQ7kNvwGmkbMf&_nc_oc=AdrFoIbXbejgVUNbYQ5_Il0bmTt20slmj4mOWDwW4E28_C5VoGx3w6NmoG1OuWC5OUA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSioiLgoqA02G0UprSR2y-U_ZdpKwCpJY-Ru15bruX2tQ&oe=6B01EC8E"}, "display_name": "VReduMed-VRoomOfHorror", "keywords": [], "long_description": "VReduMed-VRoomOfHorror is a virtual reality training application designed to help nursing students and healthcare trainees practice identifying clinical and environmental errors in a simulated patient room. The system combines a VR application with a PC-based observer client, enabling instructors to supervise or guide students in real time without the need to physically prepare evaluation rooms. The application serves as a pilot solution developed within the framework of the Interreg Central Europe project VReduMED (CE0100136).", "short_description": "VReduMed-VRoomOfHorror is a virtual reality training application designed to help nursing students and healthcare trainees practice identifying clinical and environmental errors in a simulated patient room.  The application serves as a pilot solution developed within the framework of the Interreg Central Europe project VReduMED (CE0100136)."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ddc.sze.hu/adatvedelmi-tajekoztato/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sz\u00e9chenyi Istv\u00e1n University, Digital Development Center", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://ddc.sze.hu/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "478089301798119"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQ